A note on facts vs. expression
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

In the United States, facts are not subject to copyright (Feist Publications,
Inc. v. Rural Telephone Service Co., 499 U.S. 340 (1991)). The individual
facts in this dataset — episode titles, air dates, season and episode numbers,
guest names, and the like — are not owned by anyone and you may reuse them
freely. The CC BY 4.0 license here applies to the parts that ARE protectable:
the original descriptive prose and the selection, coordination, and
arrangement of the compilation.

This dataset is a fan-compiled, best-effort reference. It contains records
marked as `partial` confidence and documented gaps; it is not an official or
authoritative record. See `README.md` for details and `docs/data-sources.md`
for provenance.
